          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũla mũlũngalu nũkwaa, na vati ũwiaa ũndũ ũsu ngoonĩ; na andũ me tei nĩmeũvetwa, vati ũmwe ũsũanĩaa kana mũlũngalu nũkũvetwe aume ũthũkunĩ ũla wũkĩte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.12.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sav 12.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake nũlikaa mũuonĩ nĩmathũmũaa mokomonĩ moo, kĩla ũmwe ũla ũendaa ũlũngalunĩ wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
